# Clerk (https://dashboard.clerk.com → API keys)
#
# Add these on Vercel: Project → Settings → Environment Variables
# (Production and Preview). Vite inlines VITE_* at build time.
#
# The GitHub Actions "Deploy to Vercel" workflow pulls this from Vercel
# *before* `bazel build //frontend:bundle`. Setting the var on Vercel
# after a deploy has no effect until you re-run that workflow.

# Required on Vercel (Production + Preview) — public, safe to expose
VITE_CLERK_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=

# Django on Vercel reads CLERK_SECRET_KEY / CLERK_AUTHORIZED_PARTIES from
# the same project env. Do not put those in this Vite file.
